   Beheiry, Salwa, Cleveland State Univ, Project Delivery Inst, Cleveland, OH USA.
   Beheiry, Salwa, Cleveland State Univ, Construct Management Program, Cleveland, OH USA.
   Mortula, Md. Maruf, Amer Univ Sharjah, Coll Engn, Dept Civil Engn, Sharjah, U Arab Emirates.},
